import-mensuration-mens-l055 9. the sum of the volumes of two spheres is \(324\pi\text{ cm}^3\). the radius of the larger sphere is equal to the diameter of the smaller sphere. express, in terms of \(\pi\),

(a) the volume of the larger sphere;

(b) the sum of the surface areas of the two spheres.
(5 marks) 9. 兩個球的體積和為 \(324\pi\text{ cm}^3\)。較大球的半徑等於較小球的直徑。以 \(\pi\) 表示:

(a) 較大球的體積;

(b) 兩個球的表面積之和。
(5 分) dse 2019 p1 q09 來源所列(未獨立核實):dse 2019 p1 q09 length, area and volume scale powers / 長度面積體積比例

import-mensuration-mens-l079 13. the height and the base radius of a solid right circular cone are 24 cm and 18 cm respectively. the circular cone is divided into three parts by two planes parallel to its base. the heights of the three parts are equal. express, in terms of \(\pi\), (a) the volume of the middle part, (b) the total surface area of the middle part. (8 marks) 13. 一個實心直立圓錐的高及底半徑分別為 \(24\) cm 及 \(18\) cm。該圓錐被兩個平行於底面的平面分成三部分,三部分高度相等。以 \(\pi\) 表示:

(a) 中間部分的體積;

(b) 中間部分的總表面積。(8 分) mock 2526 p1 q13 來源所列(未獨立核實):mock 2526 p1 q13 subtract similar cones or pyramids / 相似錐體相減
